        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ore Mania</strong> is a mining game where you dig, collect, and earn by exhibiting ores and gems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use pickaxes and bombs to dig through the underground and uncover hidden ores and jewels.<br>Be careful not to overdig—damaging exposed ores will destroy them! Once you find a vein, mine it carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell the ores you’ve mined for quick cash, or <strong>display them</strong> to earn passive income over time.<br>Use your earnings and materials to <strong>upgrade your tools and equipment</strong>, allowing you to dig deeper and discover rarer ores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through crafting, you can create useful <strong>gems (equipment)</strong> to enhance your mining efficiency.<br>Keep digging deeper and uncover the rarest treasures hidden beneath the earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106860/extras/9d8b5c17c4240ae134f8ff8468b4b38b.poster.avif?t=1784210511\" width=352 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106860/extras/9d8b5c17c4240ae134f8ff8468b4b38b.webm?t=1784210511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106860/extras/9d8b5c17c4240ae134f8ff8468b4b38b.mp4?t=1784210511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔹<strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short-session mining game using pickaxes and bombs — easy to pick up and play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Careful mining: avoid damaging exposed ores while digging</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Display mined ores to earn passive income automatically</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen and craft tools and equipment using your profits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the rarer and more valuable ores and gems you’ll discover</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are also free to do game commentary and video streaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would appreciate it if you could include a link to your Steam store page in the video description.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ore Mania</strong> is a mining game where you dig, collect, and earn by exhibiting ores and gems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use pickaxes and bombs to dig through the underground and uncover hidden ores and jewels.<br>Be careful not to overdig—damaging exposed ores will destroy them! Once you find a vein, mine it carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell the ores you’ve mined for quick cash, or <strong>display them</strong> to earn passive income over time.<br>Use your earnings and materials to <strong>upgrade your tools and equipment</strong>, allowing you to dig deeper and discover rarer ores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through crafting, you can create useful <strong>gems (equipment)</strong> to enhance your mining efficiency.<br>Keep digging deeper and uncover the rarest treasures hidden beneath the earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106860/extras/9d8b5c17c4240ae134f8ff8468b4b38b.poster.avif?t=1784210511\" width=352 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106860/extras/9d8b5c17c4240ae134f8ff8468b4b38b.webm?t=1784210511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106860/extras/9d8b5c17c4240ae134f8ff8468b4b38b.mp4?t=1784210511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔹<strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short-session mining game using pickaxes and bombs — easy to pick up and play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Careful mining: avoid damaging exposed ores while digging</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Display mined ores to earn passive income automatically</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen and craft tools and equipment using your profits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the rarer and more valuable ores and gems you’ll discover</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are also free to do game commentary and video streaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would appreciate it if you could include a link to your Steam store page in the video description.</p>",
